   "title": "Seoul shares trade up late Friday morning after Nvidia leadership turmoil",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261113/seoul-shares-start-sharply-higher-following-nvidias-leadership-change",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
