   "title": "Brazil’s Lula arrives in Manila for state visit, ASEAN Summit",
   "url": "https://www.rappler.com/philippines/brazil-lula-arrives-manila-state-visit-asean-summit-2026/",
   "domain": "rappler.com",
   "source": "rappler.com",
   "published": "Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:42:23 +0800",
   "_dt": 1794548543.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "MANILA, Philippines – Brazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva arrived in Manila on Friday, November 13, for a state visit ahead of his participation in the 49th Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) Summit . On November 14, Saturday, Lula will begin his state visit with a wreath-laying ceremony at the Rizal Monument in Manila before heading to the Philippine International Convention Center (PICC), the official venue of the ASEAN Summit and Related Summits.",
   "summary_zh": "菲律宾马尼拉——巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦于11月13日星期五抵达马尼拉，开始对中国进行国事访问。此前，他已抵达马尼拉，开始以国事访问身份出席东南亚国家联盟（东盟）第49届峰会。11月14日星期六，卢拉将在马尼拉黎刹纪念碑举行献花圈仪式，以开始对中国进行国事访问，随后前往菲律宾国际会议中心（PICC）；该中心是东盟峰会及相关会议的官方举办地。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Already have Rappler+? Sign in to listen to groundbreaking journalism. MANILA, Philippines – Brazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva arrived in Manila on Friday, November 13, for a state visit ahead of his participation in the 49th Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) Summit . Lula, the first Brazilian president to conduct a state visit to the Philippines, was accompanied by First Lady Rosāngela Lula Da Silva and his official delegation. Before he got in his vehicle, Lula paused to watch the cultural performance in honor of his arrival. On November 14, Saturday, Lula will begin his state visit with a wreath-laying ceremony at the Rizal Monument in Manila before heading to the Philippine International Convention Center (PICC), the official venue of the ASEAN Summit and Related Summits. The Bazilian leader will have a téte-a-téte with President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. in the Private Office of the Delegation Building at the PICC before joining their respective officials for an expanded bilateral meeting. After the meeting, the two leaders will witness the presentation of signed bilateral agreements and will have a joint press statement. Lula, as guest of the chair, will join other leaders at the ASEAN Summit, which will take place from November 15 to 17. He first attended the ASEAN Summit, also as guest of the chair, in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia, last year. Lula’s Manila visit comes just weeks after he won an unprecedented fourth term , and coincides with the 80th year of Philippines-Brazil relations. – Rappler.com Upgrade to Rappler+ for exclusive content and unlimited access",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "ph"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
   "usHit": false,
   "terrHit": false,
   "riskHit": false,
   "riskKind": "",
   "score": 0.6,
   "tag": "rss_rappler",
   "title_zh": "巴西总统Lula抵达马尼拉进行国事访问并出席东盟峰会",
   "body_zh": "已经订阅Rappler+？登录即可收听具有开创性的新闻报道。马尼拉，菲律宾——巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦于11月13日星期五抵达马尼拉，对菲律宾进行国事访问，并准备参加第49届东南亚国家联盟（ASEAN）峰会。卢拉是首位对菲律宾进行国事访问的巴西总统，第一夫人罗桑热拉·卢拉·达席尔瓦及其官方代表团陪同他出访。上车前，卢拉停下脚步，观看了一场为欢迎他到来而举行的文化表演。11月14日星期六，卢拉将在马尼拉黎刹纪念碑举行献花礼，开始其国事访问，随后前往菲律宾国际会议中心（PICC），这里是东盟峰会及相关峰会的官方举办地。这位巴西领导人将在PICC代表团大楼私人办公室与费迪南德·马科斯 Jr.总统举行单独会晤，之后再与双方官员举行扩大双边会议。会议结束后，两位领导人将见证已签署的双边协议交换，并发表联合新闻声明。卢拉将作为主席贵宾出席11月15日至17日举行的东盟峰会。去年，他曾以主席贵宾身份首次参加在马来西亚吉隆坡举行的东盟峰会。卢拉访问马尼拉是在他赢得史无前例的第四个任期仅数周之后，也恰逢菲律宾与巴西建交80周年。——Rappler.com 升级至Rappler+，即可畅享独家内容和无限访问权限",
