   "summary": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky warned European leaders Thursday to be wary of discussions between the United States and Russia about a new security arrangement for the continent. Before launching the war in 2022, the Kremlin delivered an ultimatum to NATO on Europe's security arrangements which included demands for the alliance to withdraw forces from eastern Europe and stop accepting new members.",
   "summary_zh": "乌克兰总统弗拉基米尔·泽连斯基星期四警告欧洲领导人，要警惕美国与俄罗斯就欧洲大陆新安全安排举行的讨论。2022年发动战争前，克里姆林宫曾向北大西洋公约组织发出最后通牒，要求该联盟从东欧撤军，并停止接纳新成员。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky warned European leaders Thursday to be wary of discussions between the United States and Russia about a new security arrangement for the continent. Before launching the war in 2022, the Kremlin delivered an ultimatum to NATO on Europe's security arrangements which included demands for the alliance to withdraw forces from eastern Europe and stop accepting new members. FRANCE 24's Caroline Baum reports",
