   "title": "Korean won hits 15-day high against US dollar on foreign inflows",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261112/korean-won-hits-15-day-high-against-us-dollar-on-foreign-inflows",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
